#: ../../../../../psynet-package/psynet/templates/final-page-bonuses.html:4
#, python-format, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In addition to your base payment of <strong>$%(BASE_PAYMENT)s</strong> you "
"will receive a bonus of <strong>$%(BONUS)s</strong> for the time you spent "
"on the experiment."
